        <span class="px-[0.7rem] pt-[0.55rem] pb-[0.2rem] font-mono text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-subtle nav-menu-group">Use cases</span>
        <StxLink to="/use-cases">All use cases</StxLink>
